WEBVTT

00:00:02.310 --> 00:00:08.150
The cries of insects during the long night of the red moon

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:13.550
reminds me of a fleeting soul.

00:00:16.930 --> 00:00:22.700
Kamono Yasunori-<i>sama.</i>
He was truly a great man.

00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:25.730
To think that the great <i>onmyou</i> professor

00:00:25.730 --> 00:00:29.270
would meet his end in such a way.

00:00:29.270 --> 00:00:32.070
He must have had so many regrets.

00:00:32.070 --> 00:00:37.510
That is why we chose to dedicate this poetry gathering to Yasunori-<i>dono.</i>

00:00:37.510 --> 00:00:39.210
Now, Masamune-<i>dono.</i>

00:00:39.210 --> 00:00:41.850
It is your turn next.

00:00:41.850 --> 00:00:45.220
Yes. Then, my passage.

00:00:45.220 --> 00:00:54.100
Redder than the red of the red moon...

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:00.570
Wait.

00:01:00.570 --> 00:01:02.100
Yes?

00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:05.210
Please forgive me! Please forgive me!

00:01:05.210 --> 00:01:09.040
It will be fine! It will be fine!

00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:11.750
So fresh. A new girl?

00:01:11.750 --> 00:01:13.440
Please stop.

00:01:16.580 --> 00:01:18.550
Y-You?!

00:01:18.550 --> 00:01:21.930
Darling!

00:01:27.300 --> 00:01:30.930
<i>The white lotus flower blooms</i>

00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:37.640
<i>The key to the bright night sky appears</i>

00:01:37.640 --> 00:01:43.280
<i>And now the hazy barrier fades away</i>

00:01:43.280 --> 00:01:48.420
<i>The unstoppable fate of time</i>

00:01:48.420 --> 00:01:52.980
<i>The ever repeating link</i>

00:01:53.620 --> 00:02:00.630
<i>Madder red clouds are swallowed up by darkness</i>

00:02:00.630 --> 00:02:05.870
<i>Swirling desire gives it strength</i>

00:02:05.870 --> 00:02:11.940
<i>A darkness that even provokes this love</i>

00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:13.880
<i>Quick as lightning</i>

00:02:13.880 --> 00:02:16.980
<i>Illusions, show your true form</i>

00:02:16.980 --> 00:02:22.180
<i>Sky, storm violently</i>

00:02:22.180 --> 00:02:27.820
<i>As the fang of steel shines with a golden gleam</i>

00:02:27.820 --> 00:02:37.820
<i>Why do people yearn for love so much</i> <i>their souls become dyed with crimson?</i>

00:02:38.330 --> 00:02:43.870
<i>Protect it to the end!</i>

00:02:43.870 --> 00:02:46.570
<i>Toward the light of the pure white lotus.</i>

00:02:46.570 --> 00:02:50.850
<i>AH... GARO</i>

00:02:50.180 --> 00:02:52.020
"GARO: CRIMSON MOON"

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:57.030
"WORST"

00:02:57.490 --> 00:03:01.590
She is a demon! That woman is a demon!

00:03:01.590 --> 00:03:05.930
She says that poetry gatherings are now forbidden at the house!

00:03:05.930 --> 00:03:07.500
Life is so fleeting.

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:09.360
However, it is understandable.

00:03:09.360 --> 00:03:12.600
You laid your hands on a servant in the middle of a gathering.

00:03:12.600 --> 00:03:15.670
I did not! A failed attempt! A failed attempt!

00:03:15.670 --> 00:03:18.070
The distinction is so important I must say it twice!

00:03:18.070 --> 00:03:19.670
It is the same thing.

00:03:19.670 --> 00:03:21.880
So, have you done your homework?

00:03:21.880 --> 00:03:22.680
Homework?

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:24.080
Your poem.

00:03:24.080 --> 00:03:27.100
Aren't you here to learn of poetry?

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:30.050
Oh, that is right!

00:03:30.050 --> 00:03:35.260
Redder than the red of the red moon,

00:03:35.260 --> 00:03:38.930
what sweet scent will such flower bud bloom?

00:03:38.930 --> 00:03:40.700
The worst.

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:42.260
You think so?

00:03:42.260 --> 00:03:45.600
Reprehensible and with obvious ulterior motive.

00:03:45.600 --> 00:03:48.270
Such words cannot be called poetry.

00:03:48.270 --> 00:03:49.870
You are strict.

00:03:49.870 --> 00:03:54.610
Masamune-<i>dono</i>. I will warn you as a friend.

00:03:54.610 --> 00:03:58.980
There are things that others do not know between husband and wife.

00:03:58.980 --> 00:04:06.050
You must ignore such things and look at your wife again with pure eyes.

00:04:06.050 --> 00:04:09.490
The dear woman you once fell passionately in love with

00:04:09.490 --> 00:04:13.260
will surely stand before you.

00:04:13.260 --> 00:04:17.100
You must realize this and put those feelings into words.

00:04:17.100 --> 00:04:19.800
It is then, that poetry will flow from you.

00:04:19.800 --> 00:04:21.400
Do you truly think so?

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:22.800
That is enough for today.

00:04:22.800 --> 00:04:24.640
Now, my class fee.

00:04:26.570 --> 00:04:30.510
A man who does not love his wife will not move the hearts of women.

00:04:30.510 --> 00:04:32.570
Do you truly think so?

00:04:36.650 --> 00:04:38.750
Life is so fleeting.

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:42.260
Isn't there something that can be done about his wandering eyes?

00:04:42.260 --> 00:04:43.420
That's right!

00:04:44.430 --> 00:04:45.330
Spy?

00:04:45.330 --> 00:04:47.500
On Tachibanano Masamune?

00:04:47.500 --> 00:04:51.030
I want you to act like house servants and keep an eye on him.

00:04:51.030 --> 00:04:55.690
If he lays his hands on other women,
I want to know about it.

00:04:55.690 --> 00:04:58.970
We can't punish him then and there?

00:04:58.970 --> 00:05:03.850
It is impossible for Raiko-<i>sama</i> to turn a blind eye to evil doings.

00:05:03.850 --> 00:05:07.050
Deep down, he isn't a bad man.

00:05:07.050 --> 00:05:09.520
Our families have been close even during our parents' generation.

00:05:09.520 --> 00:05:12.450
I also don't want to see his wife get hurt.

00:05:12.450 --> 00:05:14.860
I want to do something about it personally.

00:05:14.860 --> 00:05:16.790
So, please?

00:05:16.790 --> 00:05:19.890
Izumi-<i>chan</i>. I'm sorry, but I'll have to turn down this offer...

00:05:19.890 --> 00:05:24.160
The two of you owe me quite a lot in informational fees.

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:32.540
I am so bored.

00:05:32.540 --> 00:05:35.640
This woman showed no interest.

00:05:35.640 --> 00:05:38.010
This one has yet to reply.

00:05:38.010 --> 00:05:39.480
This woman...

00:05:50.020 --> 00:05:54.060
Look at your wife again with pure eyes.

00:05:54.060 --> 00:06:00.030
Write of the dear woman you once fell passionately in love with.

00:06:00.030 --> 00:06:05.340
The beauty before my eyes on that day,

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:10.510
has turned so foul a monstrosity...

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:13.050
It is of no use.

00:06:13.050 --> 00:06:15.120
Oh, are you awake?

00:06:15.120 --> 00:06:17.350
What are you writing?

00:06:17.350 --> 00:06:19.720
I am balancing our accounts.

00:06:19.720 --> 00:06:25.190
The previous servant girl has left us, so I have hired a new one.

00:06:25.190 --> 00:06:29.200
Our kitchen is also suffering, so I am calculating the possible costs.

00:06:29.200 --> 00:06:31.430
What an obvious show!

00:06:31.430 --> 00:06:35.540
She took the budget for the parties and still counts money before me!

00:06:35.540 --> 00:06:38.570
Such an insinuating attitude!

00:06:38.570 --> 00:06:40.480
H-Hey, Darling.

00:06:40.480 --> 00:06:44.550
There is no reason to do such a thing in my quarters.

00:06:44.550 --> 00:06:46.250
I am doing it for you.

00:06:46.250 --> 00:06:52.490
You hardly service the court and play around day after day.

00:06:52.490 --> 00:06:54.820
Because of it, the house budget is being burnt away.

00:06:54.820 --> 00:06:57.760
No, this is not about money.

00:06:57.760 --> 00:07:01.960
I want you to take things seriously as the head of this household!

00:07:01.960 --> 00:07:06.430
You were once a man with so much pride!

00:07:06.430 --> 00:07:09.440
You were passionate about your ideals and moved with cause!

00:07:09.440 --> 00:07:12.240
Every night you visited me,

00:07:12.240 --> 00:07:15.950
you claimed you would go up the ranks and bring me happiness.

00:07:15.950 --> 00:07:17.610
What has become of that?

00:07:17.610 --> 00:07:23.950
Now you wander to other women and even lay hands on our servant girl.

00:07:23.950 --> 00:07:27.590
I was the foolish one to believe in you.

00:07:27.590 --> 00:07:32.830
They call me the wife of the most worthless aristocrat in the capital.

00:07:32.830 --> 00:07:36.530
Oh, how my tears have often soaked my bed pillow!

00:07:36.530 --> 00:07:40.640
No. No. This is not about me.

00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:46.340
I only wish for you to regain that passion.

00:07:46.340 --> 00:07:51.180
I come here, knowing you will get angry, in hopes to change you.

00:07:51.180 --> 00:07:54.820
That is enough! I am tired of your self-interested kindness!

00:07:54.820 --> 00:07:56.720
I will divorce you!

00:08:00.390 --> 00:08:02.120
What did you say?

00:08:10.330 --> 00:08:15.340
I cannot say it, after all.

00:08:15.340 --> 00:08:16.470
Darling?

00:08:16.470 --> 00:08:18.010
I am going to the Light Palace.

00:08:18.010 --> 00:08:19.230
My!

00:08:22.710 --> 00:08:26.750
I didn't think Izumi-<i>chan</i> would take advantage of us like this.

00:08:26.750 --> 00:08:29.180
No matter how long she's known him,

00:08:29.180 --> 00:08:32.240
there's no need to help a guy like this.

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:33.550
I don't understand women.

00:08:33.550 --> 00:08:36.720
However, we have to pay back the debts that we owe.

00:08:36.720 --> 00:08:37.990
Turn at that corner.

00:08:37.990 --> 00:08:38.450
Huh?

00:08:38.450 --> 00:08:40.560
Were you not going to the Light Palace?

00:08:40.560 --> 00:08:43.960
I changed my mind. I will go greet a relative.

00:08:47.900 --> 00:08:49.840
It has been a long time, Uncle.

00:08:49.840 --> 00:08:51.870
Have you been well?

00:08:51.870 --> 00:08:53.270
Yes, thank you.

00:08:53.270 --> 00:08:56.910
By the way, how old are you now?

00:08:56.910 --> 00:08:58.390
I have turned fourteen.

00:08:58.390 --> 00:09:01.880
I see. I see. You are so cute!

00:09:03.780 --> 00:09:06.220
Even a man like that has relatives, huh?

00:09:06.220 --> 00:09:07.620
It must be his mother's side.

00:09:07.620 --> 00:09:10.890
I have heard he has already been denounced by his family.

00:09:12.790 --> 00:09:15.230
--It will be fine! It will be fine!
--Please forgive me!

00:09:15.230 --> 00:09:16.530
Please forgive me!

00:09:16.530 --> 00:09:18.870
It will be fine! It will be fine!

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:20.640
Stop!

00:09:20.640 --> 00:09:22.540
S-Scum!

00:09:22.540 --> 00:09:26.610
Do not interfere!
Izumi-<i>chan</i> said not to interfere!

00:09:26.610 --> 00:09:28.140
Mother!

00:09:28.140 --> 00:09:29.410
Masamune-<i>dono</i>!

00:09:29.410 --> 00:09:31.980
Are you trying to sully my daughter?!

00:09:31.980 --> 00:09:34.720
How frustrating! How unforgivable!

00:09:34.720 --> 00:09:36.720
Looks like the danger has passed.

00:09:36.720 --> 00:09:37.990
Please forgive me!

00:09:37.990 --> 00:09:38.620
Huh?

00:09:38.620 --> 00:09:41.590
It will be fine! It will be fine!

00:09:41.590 --> 00:09:44.160
D-Demon!

00:09:44.160 --> 00:09:47.830
Do not interfere!
Izumi-<i>chan</i> said not to interfere!

00:09:47.830 --> 00:09:50.160
Goodness, it can't be helped!

00:09:50.160 --> 00:09:51.460
Huh?!

00:09:55.570 --> 00:09:56.840
I'm tired.

00:09:56.840 --> 00:10:03.180
We shouldn't have accepted this job, after all.

00:10:03.180 --> 00:10:04.450
Stop the carriage.

00:10:04.450 --> 00:10:05.150
Yes!

00:10:05.150 --> 00:10:07.820
Girl, come hither.

00:10:07.820 --> 00:10:10.320
He's planning to take them to a mansion somewhere!

00:10:10.320 --> 00:10:13.590
Let's hand him over to Izumi-<i>chan</i> immediately!

00:10:13.590 --> 00:10:14.460
Change places with me!

00:10:14.460 --> 00:10:15.520
All right! Let's go!

00:10:15.520 --> 00:10:15.920
Yes!

00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:18.130
Please stop! Please stop!

00:10:18.130 --> 00:10:20.600
It will be fine. It will be fine.

00:10:20.600 --> 00:10:23.270
Nooo!

00:10:23.270 --> 00:10:25.000
Kintoki, don't stop me!

00:10:25.000 --> 00:10:28.870
Raiko-<i>sama</i>. A Makai Knight cannot cut down a human.

00:10:33.610 --> 00:10:35.340
Welcome home.

00:10:35.340 --> 00:10:36.810
Yes.

00:10:36.810 --> 00:10:38.950
We will take our leave now.

00:10:38.950 --> 00:10:40.880
Excuse us.

00:10:40.880 --> 00:10:42.380
My heart has been broken.

00:10:42.380 --> 00:10:45.690
I will make you something delicious when we get home.

00:10:45.690 --> 00:10:46.550
Wait.

00:10:46.550 --> 00:10:47.290
Huh?

00:10:47.290 --> 00:10:50.160
I have something to ask you.

00:10:50.160 --> 00:10:53.060
Where did my husband go today?

00:10:53.060 --> 00:10:54.500
Wh-Where, you ask?

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:56.460
O-O-Of course, he went to the Light Palace.

00:10:56.460 --> 00:11:01.170
I sent someone and confirmed that he did not go to the Light Palace.

00:11:01.170 --> 00:11:05.910
Answer me. Where did my husband go and what did he do?

00:11:05.910 --> 00:11:07.340
Answer me!

00:11:11.010 --> 00:11:15.380
She is a demon! That woman is a demon!

00:11:15.380 --> 00:11:17.850
She has kicked me out of the house!

00:11:17.850 --> 00:11:19.520
Life is so fleeting.

00:11:19.520 --> 00:11:21.160
However, it is understandable.

00:11:21.160 --> 00:11:25.230
I warned you and you laid your hands on three women the very same day.

00:11:25.230 --> 00:11:28.100
I only succeeded with one! One!

00:11:28.100 --> 00:11:30.430
The distinction is so important I must say it twice!

00:11:30.430 --> 00:11:32.070
The two of you, there!

00:11:32.070 --> 00:11:36.870
How dare you pretend to be servants and tell that woman such things!

00:11:36.870 --> 00:11:42.880
How vile! How underhanded!
Are you truly men? Even human?!

00:11:42.880 --> 00:11:45.250
You have no right to tell me that!

00:11:45.250 --> 00:11:47.420
All of this was your doing!

00:11:47.420 --> 00:11:50.380
Save me. Save me.

00:11:50.380 --> 00:11:51.420
Now, now.

00:11:51.420 --> 00:11:53.620
Please don't stop me, Izumi-<i>chan.</i>

00:11:53.620 --> 00:11:56.790
I have to punch this man in the face at least once!

00:11:56.790 --> 00:11:57.850
Ouch!

00:11:59.290 --> 00:12:02.230
Men and women are complicated.

00:12:02.230 --> 00:12:05.130
Placing the blame on someone after all this time

00:12:05.130 --> 00:12:09.040
is like arguing whether the egg or the chicken came first.

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:13.440
However, your love of women has become a disease!

00:12:13.440 --> 00:12:15.040
Truly?

00:12:15.040 --> 00:12:19.980
It is not easy to fix this.
You should stay here for a while...

00:12:19.980 --> 00:12:22.140
And give up women!

00:12:23.550 --> 00:12:25.420
Um, Izumi-<i>chan.</i>

00:12:25.420 --> 00:12:27.250
Why are there three futon mattresses?

00:12:27.250 --> 00:12:31.630
So the two of you can keep an eye on Masamune-<i>dono</i>, of course.

00:12:31.630 --> 00:12:33.630
He is a man you cannot take your eyes off for even a minute.

00:12:33.630 --> 00:12:35.660
Well, good night.

00:12:35.660 --> 00:12:40.700
Let me out! Let me out!
I do not want to sleep beside men!

00:12:40.700 --> 00:12:45.110
I cannot sleep with a foreign pillow!

00:12:45.110 --> 00:12:47.780
He fell asleep!

00:12:47.780 --> 00:12:52.740
What a beautiful neckline. I want to bite it.

00:12:57.350 --> 00:12:58.920
You can't sleep?

00:12:58.920 --> 00:13:00.320
That moon.

00:13:00.320 --> 00:13:02.990
When the moon drenched in that color,

00:13:02.990 --> 00:13:06.660
the Horror's power got stronger.

00:13:06.660 --> 00:13:08.700
I have a bad premonition.

00:13:08.700 --> 00:13:11.630
I shouldn't waste my time on things like this.

00:13:11.630 --> 00:13:16.000
Well, you must rest so you can respond to any such situation!

00:13:21.680 --> 00:13:24.980
The mother this afternoon was truly nice.

00:13:24.980 --> 00:13:27.510
I cannot forget that neckline!

00:13:29.320 --> 00:13:33.950
Kitten. I have come!

00:13:53.480 --> 00:13:59.060
The number of murdered aristocrat women have increased lately.

00:13:59.060 --> 00:14:02.230
They were all women involved with Masamune-<i>dono.</i>

00:14:02.230 --> 00:14:05.430
Of course, Masamune-<i>dono</i> is under suspicion.

00:14:05.430 --> 00:14:08.670
We, his close friends, were also investigated.

00:14:08.670 --> 00:14:09.900
He is being framed!

00:14:09.900 --> 00:14:14.410
That man could not do something so terrible!

00:14:14.410 --> 00:14:20.040
The claims of his wife seemed empty, increasing suspicion.

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:25.050
And now the public suspect that we are all accomplices.

00:14:25.050 --> 00:14:25.580
Then?

00:14:25.580 --> 00:14:27.080
Masamune-<i>dono.</i>

00:14:27.080 --> 00:14:28.950
Turn yourself in!

00:14:28.950 --> 00:14:31.920
I did not do it! I am not the culprit!

00:14:31.920 --> 00:14:33.290
I wonder?

00:14:33.290 --> 00:14:37.730
You escaped the bedroom on the night of the first victim.

00:14:37.730 --> 00:14:41.300
And you said you wanted to bite her neck in your sleep.

00:14:41.300 --> 00:14:45.540
And since then, you have not been quiet a single night.

00:14:45.540 --> 00:14:48.740
Unrepeatable words escaped your lips as you slept!

00:14:48.740 --> 00:14:49.910
I-I do not know!

00:14:49.910 --> 00:14:52.410
I cannot remember the words I say while asleep!

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:57.880
What? Do you have some irrefutable proof it was me?!

00:14:57.880 --> 00:14:59.380
This!

00:14:59.380 --> 00:15:00.280
Kintoki!

00:15:00.280 --> 00:15:01.380
Yes!

00:15:04.490 --> 00:15:05.920
He isn't?!

00:15:05.920 --> 00:15:08.930
A man with so much darkness around him?!

00:15:08.930 --> 00:15:10.660
Kintoki, the Watchdog Center!

00:15:10.660 --> 00:15:13.130
Yes!

00:15:13.130 --> 00:15:15.400
I am sorry for your troubles.

00:15:15.400 --> 00:15:18.800
Staying any longer will attract unwanted attention.

00:15:18.800 --> 00:15:22.670
It may be unnecessary to say, but please keep quiet about this.

00:15:22.670 --> 00:15:26.010
Of course. Oh, that is right.

00:15:26.010 --> 00:15:28.310
I received this from his wife.

00:15:29.910 --> 00:15:32.520
Life is so fleeting.

00:15:32.520 --> 00:15:37.250
Izumi-<i>chan</i>. You believe me, don't you?

00:15:37.250 --> 00:15:39.990
I love women!

00:15:39.990 --> 00:15:44.460
What need would I have to kill the women I love?

00:15:44.460 --> 00:15:47.000
This is from your wife.

00:15:47.000 --> 00:15:48.830
After that?

00:15:48.830 --> 00:15:57.840
If naught for evil women, the heart of my love would never bleed.

00:15:57.840 --> 00:16:00.880
If this world did not have evil women,

00:16:00.880 --> 00:16:06.120
you would never be hurt by such baseless rumors.

00:16:06.120 --> 00:16:08.320
She believes in me.

00:16:08.320 --> 00:16:11.720
That woman believes in my innocence!

00:16:14.330 --> 00:16:18.560
Wandering out of the darkness of lust,

00:16:18.560 --> 00:16:23.400
I gaze upon the face of my kind-hearted wife.

00:16:23.400 --> 00:16:24.400
You pass.

00:16:24.400 --> 00:16:26.670
--Huh?
--It was a beautiful poem.

00:16:26.670 --> 00:16:30.070
There is no longer anything to teach you.

00:16:30.070 --> 00:16:31.240
Izumi-<i>chan.</i>

00:16:31.240 --> 00:16:33.810
You have recovered from your love of other women.

00:16:33.810 --> 00:16:38.920
Please feel free to go to your wife.

00:16:38.920 --> 00:16:41.420
I caused you trouble.

00:16:41.420 --> 00:16:42.990
My heart feels light.

00:16:42.990 --> 00:16:49.760
I will face the inspections and the public head on!

00:16:49.760 --> 00:16:54.400
I have someone who will stand beside me until the end.

00:16:54.400 --> 00:16:56.100
Yes.

00:16:56.100 --> 00:16:57.760
Farewell!

00:17:02.710 --> 00:17:04.440
Izumi-<i>chan</i>?

00:17:04.440 --> 00:17:05.940
Life is so fleeting.

00:17:05.940 --> 00:17:08.350
I have known you for so long,

00:17:08.350 --> 00:17:11.950
yet this is the first time I see you as a man.

00:17:11.950 --> 00:17:14.250
Perhaps this is what it means to be a woman.

00:17:14.250 --> 00:17:19.790
The moment you turn to your wife, my heart aches.

00:17:19.790 --> 00:17:21.860
I-Izumi-<i>chan...</i>

00:17:21.860 --> 00:17:23.860
Am I an evil woman?

00:17:23.860 --> 00:17:26.460
N-N-Not at all.

00:17:26.460 --> 00:17:33.370
♪ Long have we known one another, yet I realize the manliness too late. ♪

00:17:33.370 --> 00:17:38.610
♪ Life is so fleeting. ♪

00:17:38.610 --> 00:17:40.940
Darling! Welcome home!

00:17:40.940 --> 00:17:42.480
I caused you worry.

00:17:42.480 --> 00:17:44.580
I will not go anywhere.

00:17:44.580 --> 00:17:47.750
I will be by your side tonight.

00:17:47.750 --> 00:17:50.780
Oh, how happy your words make me.

00:17:57.730 --> 00:18:00.130
Izumi-<i>chan.</i>

00:18:00.130 --> 00:18:02.620
Such soft earlobes.

00:18:06.670 --> 00:18:08.940
Wh-Wh-What are...

00:18:08.940 --> 00:18:11.180
Why are you surprised?

00:18:11.180 --> 00:18:16.150
Is this not the form you have always seen me?

00:18:16.150 --> 00:18:19.950
D-D-Did you kill those women?!

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:24.620
I laid my hands on those women, just as you did.

00:18:24.620 --> 00:18:28.330
H-H-How did you know?

00:18:28.330 --> 00:18:32.000
Charm point of relative's mother, neckline.

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:33.800
Next woman, breasts.

00:18:33.800 --> 00:18:36.100
The woman after that, buttocks.

00:18:37.300 --> 00:18:39.840
How could I <i>not</i> bubble with rage?

00:18:39.840 --> 00:18:42.810
How could I stand not getting revenge?!

00:18:42.810 --> 00:18:46.940
Do you want power? The power to get revenge?

00:18:46.940 --> 00:18:49.710
I want it!

00:18:55.490 --> 00:18:58.720
Don't worry. I won't kill you.

00:18:58.720 --> 00:19:03.890
I need you executed for killing all of those women.

00:19:03.890 --> 00:19:07.230
Izumi-<i>chan</i>, with her earlobe charm point.

00:19:07.230 --> 00:19:09.960
I'm coming for you!

00:19:14.340 --> 00:19:16.470
The Watchdog Center didn't know anything.

00:19:16.470 --> 00:19:20.580
It makes you wonder if they're doing their job properly.

00:19:20.580 --> 00:19:21.880
Horror!

00:19:21.880 --> 00:19:23.550
Makai Knight!

00:19:23.550 --> 00:19:27.320
That resemblance.
You must be Masamune's wife!

00:19:27.320 --> 00:19:29.590
Why did you kill those women?

00:19:29.590 --> 00:19:32.090
If you harbored so much darkness against him,

00:19:32.090 --> 00:19:34.220
you should have killed him directly!

00:19:35.030 --> 00:19:37.530
A fool that doesn't understand women.

00:19:37.530 --> 00:19:40.330
Women are different from men!

00:19:51.110 --> 00:19:52.610
Don't underestimate me.

00:19:52.610 --> 00:19:56.570
We are no longer the Horrors you once knew!

00:20:07.590 --> 00:20:10.590
Seimei!

00:20:10.590 --> 00:20:15.100
I mirrored the woman inside your heart.

00:20:15.100 --> 00:20:18.470
Well? Can you fight her?

00:20:18.470 --> 00:20:21.440
Can you defeat this woman?!

00:20:21.440 --> 00:20:25.210
You cannot fight her! You cannot defeat her!

00:20:25.640 --> 00:20:28.310
That is how men are!

00:20:33.820 --> 00:20:35.810
What?

00:20:39.220 --> 00:20:40.990
Don't underestimate me.

00:20:40.990 --> 00:20:43.830
Such illusions will not work against me.

00:20:50.930 --> 00:20:53.270
I caused you much trouble.

00:20:53.270 --> 00:20:58.010
Your testimonies have cleared my name.

00:20:58.010 --> 00:21:00.680
This is a small token of my appreciation.

00:21:00.680 --> 00:21:04.780
What will you do now, without your wife?

00:21:04.780 --> 00:21:07.120
I mistreated her.

00:21:07.120 --> 00:21:11.290
I wish to mourn for her loss and give her a proper service.

00:21:11.290 --> 00:21:13.320
That is honorable of you.

00:21:13.320 --> 00:21:14.590
Well, then.

00:21:16.030 --> 00:21:18.460
Thank you for all your hard work.

00:21:18.460 --> 00:21:24.430
Your debts until now are cleared.
I don't mind even giving a reward.

00:21:24.430 --> 00:21:26.940
I'd like you to check something.

00:21:26.940 --> 00:21:28.670
What?

00:21:28.670 --> 00:21:33.980
The Crimson Moon.
I want to know why the moon is like that.

00:21:33.980 --> 00:21:35.970
I'll research it.

00:21:40.280 --> 00:21:41.890
I don't understand.

00:21:41.890 --> 00:21:42.690
Understand what?

00:21:42.690 --> 00:21:47.860
The women Masamune's wife murdered were all involved with Masamune.

00:21:47.860 --> 00:21:49.730
What about it?

00:21:49.730 --> 00:21:55.070
Why did she appear at Izumi-<i>chan</i>'s dwelling?

00:21:55.070 --> 00:21:57.160
Should I have asked about that instead?

00:21:58.870 --> 00:22:00.740
She is dead.

00:22:00.740 --> 00:22:03.350
She has finally died!

00:22:07.880 --> 00:22:13.180
I am now free!

00:22:15.490 --> 00:22:17.750
I am now free.

00:22:17.750 --> 00:22:19.590
Life is so fleeting.

00:22:53.290 --> 00:23:01.230
<i>Whilst looking at the filling moon</i>

00:23:01.230 --> 00:23:11.230
<i>Today, as well, I bury these growing feelings</i>

00:23:11.330 --> 00:23:18.380
<i>The skies of fate have split in two</i>

00:23:18.380 --> 00:23:24.380
<i>(Shine upon the darkness) Lead me</i>

00:23:25.820 --> 00:23:30.730
<i>Yearning for the light, I throw out my heart</i>

00:23:30.730 --> 00:23:35.850
<i>I will always be beside you</i>

00:23:35.850 --> 00:23:42.490
<i>So until the last moment of this life</i>

00:23:42.490 --> 00:23:47.670
<i>Let me see this fleeting dream</i>

00:23:51.040 --> 00:24:01.050
"Next Episode: SINISTER EVIL"

00:23:52.520 --> 00:23:54.250
For your master's sake.

00:23:54.250 --> 00:23:55.920
For your own sake.

00:23:55.920 --> 00:24:00.320
Continuous desire warps the shape.
